[Options]

[A.]
                                               <i>~[IwindArcher.C1]</i> UNITE!<i>~[IWindArcher.C1]</i><br>
<i>But, fellow Nimbians, follow me, and we can protect Nimbus from the insane desecrations!
                                                                                  --mosquito
<br>
<i>Not desecrate? Not fight? But what fun would we have?<br>
                                                                                                             --dubious Nimbian</i><br><br>
<p>
This is it! The four furies have sent their best disciples to stop you once and for all.
With your small group of followers, you vow to protect the weak, helpless, and unfortunate
Nimbians in the Stratosphere. Calling yourselves the THUNDER lords
(<i>T</i>otally <i>H</i>armonious, <i>U</i>nited <i>N</i>imbians <i>D</i>enouncing <i>E</i>vil<br>
 <i>R</i>ituals), you must unite together, and put an end to this carnage....<br>


$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0


[ai2PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from Light</h2>
<p>
I think we have them on the run...<br>

[ai3PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from Light</h2>
<p>
Keep up the good work...<br>

[ai4PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from Light</h2>
<p>
Oh, great mosquito....<br>
Show us the way to salvation....

[ai5PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from Light</h2>
<p>
Oh, great mosquito....<br>
Oh, great Messiah....<br>
Lead us out of harm's way...<br>
Show us the way to enlightenment....

[ai6PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from Light</h2>
<p>
Oh, great mosquito....<br>
Help us, please...<br>
In our time of need...<br>
We have been captured!



[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>Message from the Wind Fury</h2>
<p>
For the wind.....<br>
Is no more....<br>
It is done...<br>

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>Message from the Rain God</h2>
<p>
For the rain...<br>
Is no more....<br>
It is done...<br>

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>Message from the Thunder Fury</h2>
<p>
For the thunder...<br>
Is no more....<br>
It is done...<br>

[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>Message from the Furies</h2>
<p>
For the storm...<br>
Is no more....<br>
It is done...<br>

[ai6PriestDead]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
Your followers, the children of Light, have<br>
been decimated by your opponents!<br>
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
All of Nimbus rejoices in your successful victory!
Finally, a great leader has risen up from the depths, and
has the skill necessary to challenge even the most formidable
of players in Multiplayerland! (well, maybe not Lurker, or Hackett,
or Shai-Halud, or Delusional, or Havok, or Stiletto, or Spineless,
or Wufbam!, or Fear, or...)
<p>
What lies ahead for the mosquito? Only time will tell...
In the meantime, happy sacrificing!
                                                   -swelb

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0



[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
You have failed in guiding the Children of Light to victory.<br>
Don't give up now... there is too much at stake!

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[END]
